    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But that's just it... it's not a \"fresh beginning\" to me. It just feels like a comedown. A long, slow, agonizing decline into being an old man who used to be someone. I look at the symphony and I think, \"That was the peak. Why bother with the descent?\" There is a certain grace in stopping when the masterpiece is complete, rather than waiting for the talent to wither and the mind to fail.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
